OL,3,GNEWSA'I didn't know I needed the air
OL,4,Aambulance until it saved me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British equestrian rider said she did
OL,7,Fnot know how important an air ambulance
OL,8,Fwas until she needed one when she broke
OL,9,Fher back in a serious fall.
OL,11,FBubby Upton, 27, from near Newmarket,
OL,12,FSuffolk, had been training when she
OL,13,Ffell off her horse and it landed on her
OL,14,Fin August 2023.
OL,16,FShe broke several vertebrae and lost
OL,17,Ffeeling in her right leg, and was flown
OL,18,Fto hospital by the East Anglian Air
OL,19,FAmbulance, a charity she described as
OL,20,F"truly extraordinary".
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
