OL,3,GNEWSA'I didn't know I needed the air
OL,4,Aambulance until it saved me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe had to relearn how to walk and
OL,7,Fride, and now she is supporting the air
OL,8,Fambulance charity's appeal to fund a
OL,9,Fnew base near the
OL,10,FSuffolk/Cambridgeshire border.
